<title>HONG KONG: Ford Motor Credit plans global bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit plans global bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co unit Ford Motor Credit plans to launch a US$1.0 billion five-year global bond, the joint lead managers said.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs International and Salomon Brothers will jointly lead the bond issue. Goldman Sachs will act as bookrunner.</p>
<p>The transaction represents Ford Motor Credit's fourth global bond. The issue will be priced later this week.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
